   "code": "import haxefmod.core.Dsp;\nimport haxefmod.core.DspType;\n\nvar lowpass = Dsp.create(DspType.ITLOWPASS);\nlowpass.setParameter(0, 2000); // CUTOFF in Hz\nlowpass.setParameter(1, 1); // RESONANCE",
